{:tier :glm-5.2, :verse 17, :comments ["<b>Then the tent of meeting shall set out, in the midst of the camps.</b> Those mentioned, namely the Gershonites and the Merarites, travel between the standard of Judah and the standard of Reuben, and the Kohathites travel—and with them Aaron and his sons—between the standard of Judah and the standard of Ephraim:" "<b>As they encamp, so shall they travel.</b> It refers back to the camps, which are Israel, not to the camp of the Levites. For the standard of Judah encamps to the east, since the Gershonite is to the west of the sanctuary, and the Merarite to the north—together they travel:" "<b>By its side.</b> A direction and place, like יד הירדן and ויד תהיה לך."], :book :numbers, :voice :ibn-ezra, :lang :en, :chapter 2, :notes {}, :source-witnesses [["On Your Way" "http://mobile.tora.ws/"]], :timestamp "2026-07-09T19:16:00.500437022Z", :translated-from :he, :model "glm-5.2"}